link : https://www.gov.uk/standard-visitor/apply-standard-visitor-visa

                       Check-list
                       ==========

1. passport - original (if old available and latest one)
2. passport scanned pages of latest one including visa entry and exit stamps other countries
3. Aadhaar card.
4. If person is employee:
     - employment proof
     - NOC
     - leave letter
     - 6 months bank statements
     - 3 months pay-slips
     - 3 years IT Returns
     - additional income (rent,agriculture etc, per month)
     - covering letter
     - proof of ties to India to show you'll return.
     - Hotel booking
5. If person is self-employee:
     - Original passport
     - Appointment letter
     - Checklist
     - covering letter on company letterhead with stamp and signature
     - NOC on company letterhead with stamp and other other Director signature
     - firm registration copy
     - proof of his designation
     - recent 3 months bank statement with bank seal and signature(personal and firm)
     - recent 3 yrs IT Returns (personal and firm)
     - Hotel booking
     - Previous visa refusal letter(if any)
     - family members id proofs
     
6. If person is a student:
     - Original Passport
     - Appointment letter
     - Checklist
     - Summer course Invitation letter
     - Course fees paid receipts (if Any)
     - Student/ College ID card
     - Father Sponsorship letter with Signature
     - Father passport copy
     - Father recent 3 months Bank statement with Bank seal and signature
     - Father recent 3 yrs IT Acknowledgement pages
     - Her Birth Certificate
     - Hotel booking
     